{"_note":"关注的仓库:CI 状态 / 新版本两张卡与 `xJob/ci.xjob` 共用。**由 tools/infosource/gen_github_todo.py 生成,不要手改**。\n一条 GraphQL 同时问 6 个关注位(别名 r0..r5)与「你最近推送的 6 个仓库」(回落),按有没有关注位挑一段用。CI = 默认分支最新一次提交的检查汇总(statusCheckRollup),没配 CI 的仓库这个字段为 null,不进 CI 卡。\n排序用前缀和算名次再按名次取(VParser 没有 sort):CI 失败在前、新版本按发布时间倒序。","version":1,"actions":[{"op":"set","props":{"key":"t0","value":"${@time.nowMs}"}},{"_note":"关注位:首页维护,恒补齐到 6 槽(空槽 {o:'',r:''})。没有任何关注位时回落到「你自己最近推送的 6 个仓库」—— 装上就有东西看,不用先配置。","id":"slots","action":"data.get","params":{"key":"gh_slots","default":[]}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"_sb","value":"1"},"_note":"⚠️ 请求/并发屏障(勿删):request 与 concurrent 之后**紧邻**的节点读不到响应(晚一拍合并,memory [[actionflow-concurrent-late-merge]])。删掉它 → 下面所有 index:: 静默取空 → 卡渲一片 `--`,而流仍报 success。"},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"o0","value":"$[replaceAll::(findNotEmpty::(${slots[0].o},),[^A-Za-z0-9._-],)]"},"_note":"只留 GitHub 用户名 / 仓库名合法的字符:这两个值会原样拼进 GraphQL 查询,关注位可能来自导入的备份,不过滤就是一个查询注入面。"},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"n0","value":"$[replaceAll::(findNotEmpty::(${slots[0].r},),[^A-Za-z0-9._-],)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"o1","value":"$[replaceAll::(findNotEmpty::(${slots[1].o},),[^A-Za-z0-9._-],)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"n1","value":"$[replaceAll::(findNotEmpty::(${slots[1].r},),[^A-Za-z0-9._-],)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"o2","value":"$[replaceAll::(findNotEmpty::(${slots[2].o},),[^A-Za-z0-9._-],)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"n2","value":"$[replaceAll::(findNotEmpty::(${slots[2].r},),[^A-Za-z0-9._-],)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"o3","value":"$[replaceAll::(findNotEmpty::(${slots[3].o},),[^A-Za-z0-9._-],)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"n3","value":"$[replaceAll::(findNotEmpty::(${slots[3].r},),[^A-Za-z0-9._-],)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"o4","value":"$[replaceAll::(findNotEmpty::(${slots[4].o},),[^A-Za-z0-9._-],)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"n4","value":"$[replaceAll::(findNotEmpty::(${slots[4].r},),[^A-Za-z0-9._-],)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"o5","value":"$[replaceAll::(findNotEmpty::(${slots[5].o},),[^A-Za-z0-9._-],)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"n5","value":"$[replaceAll::(findNotEmpty::(${slots[5].r},),[^A-Za-z0-9._-],)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"_ns","value":["$[if::(eq::(connect::(k,${o0}),k),0,1)]","$[if::(eq::(connect::(k,${o1}),k),0,1)]","$[if::(eq::(connect::(k,${o2}),k),0,1)]","$[if::(eq::(connect::(k,${o3}),k),0,1)]","$[if::(eq::(connect::(k,${o4}),k),0,1)]","$[if::(eq::(connect::(k,${o5}),k),0,1)]"]}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"_nsb","value":"1"},"_note":"⚠️ 请求/并发屏障(勿删):request 与 concurrent 之后**紧邻**的节点读不到响应(晚一拍合并,memory [[actionflow-concurrent-late-merge]])。删掉它 → 下面所有 index:: 静默取空 → 卡渲一片 `--`,而流仍报 success。"},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"nS","value":"$[sum::(${_ns})]"},"_note":"关注位个数。先落成数组再 sum —— if 的数字输出直接进 calc 不可靠。"},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"hasS","value":"$[if::(gt::(${nS},0),1,0)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"hdr","value":{"Accept":"application/json","Content-Type":"application/json","User-Agent":"Numable"}}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"body","value":"{\"query\": \"query{viewer{login repositories(first:6,orderBy:{field:PUSHED_AT,direction:DESC},ownerAffiliations:[OWNER],isFork:false,isArchived:false){nodes{nameWithOwner url stargazerCount issues(states:OPEN){totalCount} pullRequests(states:OPEN){totalCount} latestRelease{tagName publishedAt url} defaultBranchRef{target{...on Commit{oid committedDate messageHeadline statusCheckRollup{state} checkSuites(first:10){nodes{checkRuns(first:1,filterBy:{conclusions:[FAILURE,TIMED_OUT,STARTUP_FAILURE]}){nodes{name}}}}}}}}}} r0:repository(owner:\\\"${o0}\\\",name:\\\"${n0}\\\"){nameWithOwner url stargazerCount issues(states:OPEN){totalCount} pullRequests(states:OPEN){totalCount} latestRelease{tagName publishedAt url} defaultBranchRef{target{...on Commit{oid committedDate messageHeadline statusCheckRollup{state} checkSuites(first:10){nodes{checkRuns(first:1,filterBy:{conclusions:[FAILURE,TIMED_OUT,STARTUP_FAILURE]}){nodes{name}}}}}}}} r1:repository(owner:\\\"${o1}\\\",name:\\\"${n1}\\\"){