_FAILURE]}){nodes{name}}}}}}}}}\"}"}},{"_note":"GraphQL 出错恒返 200、错误在 errors[] 里;没绑 / 令牌失效时是 401。两种情况下 data.viewer 都取不到 → 下面 ok=0,不会假绿。","id":"q","action":"request","params":{"url":"https://api.github.com/graphql","method":"POST","header":"${hdr}","body":"${body}","formatType":"json","credential":"gh"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"_b","value":"1"},"_note":"⚠️ 请求/并发屏障(勿删):request 与 concurrent 之后**紧邻**的节点读不到响应(晚一拍合并,memory [[actionflow-concurrent-late-merge]])。删掉它 → 下面所有 index:: 静默取空 → 卡渲一片 `--`,而流仍报 success。"},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"login","value":"${q.data.viewer.login}"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"ok","value":"$[if::(or::(eq::(connect::(k,${login}),k),eq::(connect::(k,${q.data.viewer.repositories.nodes}),k)),0,1)]"},"_note":"判据是 **viewer 有没有回来**,不是任何计数:待办恰好全是 0 是好消息,拿计数判会把「今天很干净」误判成「没取到」。⚠️ 用 `connect::(k,…)` 哨兵拼串再比 —— `eq` 是数字化比较,`eq::(0,)` 恒真(todo.df 2026-08-26 栽过)。\n⚠️ 还要求本条流用到的每一段都回来了(need):GraphQL 部分超时会只让某几个 search 为 null、viewer 照常返回 —— 只看 viewer 会把「没取到」渲成「都处理完了」,提醒也会判假而不是未知(2026-09-25 审查实证)。"},{"_note":"取数失败出口:viewer 没回来 = 这一轮什么都不可信(401 / 断网 / GraphQL 整体出错)。抛错让宿主走失败态 —— 不落封面、回落上次成功的数据、提醒判「未知」不响;报成功就会拿一份全空的数据盖掉好数据。⚠️ 「列表为空」是成功,不在这里判。errorMsg 是诊断串,只进运行日志,写英文。","op":"if","props":{"val":"$[if::(eq::(${ok},1),0,1)]"},"items":[{"action":"error","params":{"errorMsg":"github graphql: viewer missing (auth or network)"}}]},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"v_nm","value":"$[pluck::(${q.data.viewer.repositories.nodes},nameWithOwner)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"x0nm","value":"$[findNotEmpty::(if::(eq::(${hasS},1),${q.data.r0.nameWithOwner},index::(${v_nm},0)),)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"x1nm","value":"$[findNotEmpty::(if::(eq::(${hasS},1),${q.data.r1.nameWithOwner},index::(${v_nm},1)),)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"x2nm","value":"$[findNotEmpty::(if::(eq::(${hasS},1),${q.data.r2.nameWithOwner},index::(${v_nm},2)),)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"x3nm","value":"$[findNotEmpty::(if::(eq::(${hasS},1),${q.data.r3.nameWithOwner},index::(${v_nm},3)),)]"}},{"op":"s